{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Hey Mel! Good to see you! How have you been?"}, "creation_event": "h4a-amem-ingest-h4a-real-locomo-smoke-1-amem-fixed-locomo-conv-26/session_1-382a7d2bd49edd8c0dd1e722", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T08:09:29.996604+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "382a7d2bd49edd8c0dd1e722", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "382a7d2bd49edd8c0dd1e722", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Hey Caroline! Good to see you! I'm swamped with the kids & work. What's up with you? Anything new?"}, "creation_event": "h4a-amem-ingest-h4a-real-locomo-smoke-1-amem-fixed-locomo-conv-26/session_1-6e524d019e49f59bcf742958", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T08:09:34.138027+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6e524d019e49f59bcf742958", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6e524d019e49f59bcf742958", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: I went to a LGBTQ support group yesterday and it was so powerful."}, "creation_event": "h4a-amem-ingest-h4a-real-locomo-smoke-1-amem-fixed-locomo-conv-26/session_1-0a2bbeb23bfc6abe6a886f09", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T08:09:38.264432+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0a2bbeb23bfc6abe6a886f09", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0a2bbeb23bfc6abe6a886f09", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Wow, that's cool, Caroline! What happened that was so awesome? Did you hear any inspiring stories?"}, "creation_event": "h4a-amem-ingest-h4a-real-locomo-smoke-1-amem-fixed-locomo-conv-26/session_1-6de6d7cb3bb7501dbef49f88", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T08:09:42.388901+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6de6d7cb3bb7501dbef49f88", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6de6d7cb3bb7501dbef49f88", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: The transgender stories were so inspiring! I was so happy and thankful for all the support."}, "creation_event": "h4a-amem-ingest-h4a-real-locomo-smoke-1-amem-fixed-locomo-conv-26/session_1-82172fb18cea047df88299be", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T08:09:46.482534+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "82172fb18cea047df88299be", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "82172fb18cea047df88299be", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Wow, love that painting! So cool you found such a helpful group. What's it done for you?"}, "creation_event": "h4a-amem-ingest-h4a-real-locomo-smoke-1-amem-fixed-locomo-conv-26/session_1-40efb962b29908cc053045d4", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T08:09:50.597608+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "40efb962b29908cc053045d4", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "40efb962b29908cc053045d4", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: The support group has made me feel accepted and given me courage to embrace myself."}, "creation_event": "h4a-amem-ingest-h4a-real-locomo-smoke-1-amem-fixed-locomo-conv-26/session_1-bb046bbd0b4a7d9b7cf15e51", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T08:09:54.725819+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "bb046bbd0b4a7d9b7cf15e51", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "bb046bbd0b4a7d9b7cf15e51", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: That's really cool. You've got guts. What now?"}, "creation_event": "h4a-amem-ingest-h4a-real-locomo-smoke-1-amem-fixed-locomo-conv-26/session_1-d6229e0ac079928d7d0efe60", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T08:09:58.820461+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d6229e0ac079928d7d0efe60", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d6229e0ac079928d7d0efe60", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Gonna continue my edu and check out career options, which is pretty exciting!"}, "creation_event": "h4a-amem-ingest-h4a-real-locomo-smoke-1-amem-fixed-locomo-conv-26/session_1-66586fce1d73ce9515f4ee78", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T08:10:02.933032+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "66586fce1d73ce9515f4ee78", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "66586fce1d73ce9515f4ee78", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Wow, Caroline! What kinda jobs are you thinkin' of? Anything that stands out?"}, "creation_event": "h4a-amem-ingest-h4a-real-locomo-smoke-1-amem-fixed-locomo-conv-26/session_1-87a7f792c8d5c7bb02182685", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T08:10:07.033360+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "87a7f792c8d5c7bb02182685", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "87a7f792c8d5c7bb02182685", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: I'm keen on counseling or working in mental health - I'd love to support those with similar issues."}, "creation_event": "h4a-amem-ingest-h4a-real-locomo-smoke-1-amem-fixed-locomo-conv-26/session_1-832292b02aca5c535db6c3bf", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T08:10:11.148641+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "832292b02aca5c535db6c3bf", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "832292b02aca5c535db6c3bf", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: You'd be a great counselor! Your empathy and understanding will really help the people you work with. By the way, take a look at this."}, "creation_event": "h4a-amem-ingest-h4a-real-locomo-smoke-1-amem-fixed-locomo-conv-26/session_1-a2fbb849a9901d047670e610", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T08:10:15.281837+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a2fbb849a9901d047670e610", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a2fbb849a9901d047670e610", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Thanks, Melanie! That's really sweet. Is this your own painting?"}, "creation_event": "h4a-amem-ingest-h4a-real-locomo-smoke-1-amem-fixed-locomo-conv-26/session_1-bf86996d9529669aef9a175d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T08:10:19.409045+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "bf86996d9529669aef9a175d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "bf86996d9529669aef9a175d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Yeah, I painted that lake sunrise last year! It's special to me."}, "creation_event": "h4a-amem-ingest-h4a-real-locomo-smoke-1-amem-fixed-locomo-conv-26/session_1-31b0e6cf520ce707315f8b82", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T08:10:23.497161+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "31b0e6cf520ce707315f8b82", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "31b0e6cf520ce707315f8b82", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Wow, Melanie! The colors really blend nicely. Painting looks like a great outlet for expressing yourself."}, "creation_event": "h4a-amem-ingest-h4a-real-locomo-smoke-1-amem-fixed-locomo-conv-26/session_1-2cfbf2e06b5f5d2cc73b7e52", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T08:10:27.616857+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2cfbf2e06b5f5d2cc73b7e52", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2cfbf2e06b5f5d2cc73b7e52", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Thanks, Caroline! Painting's a fun way to express my feelings and get creative. It's a great way to relax after a long day."}, "creation_event": "h4a-amem-ingest-h4a-real-locomo-smoke-1-amem-fixed-locomo-conv-26/session_1-1ca230f9aca53678d11ebd41", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T08:10:31.745261+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1ca230f9aca53678d11ebd41", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1ca230f9aca53678d11ebd41", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Totally agree, Mel. Relaxing and expressing ourselves is key. Well, I'm off to go do some research."}, "creation_event": "h4a-amem-ingest-h4a-real-locomo-smoke-1-amem-fixed-locomo-conv-26/session_1-9858d64d097063fb2b25e06b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T08:10:35.881378+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9858d64d097063fb2b25e06b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9858d64d097063fb2b25e06b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Yep, Caroline. Taking care of ourselves is vital. I'm off to go swimming with the kids. Talk to you soon!"}, "creation_event": "h4a-amem-ingest-h4a-real-locomo-smoke-1-amem-fixed-locomo-conv-26/session_1-cd26b68f293e85efb0f62ca9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T08:10:40.009554+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "cd26b68f293e85efb0f62ca9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "cd26b68f293e85efb0f62ca9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
